Registers grove-g1's simulation-only grasp weld in the vendored unitree_mujoco.

Generated against unitree_mujoco ae6a8403e272733e9996ef59990880330496177f, on top of 001 and 004.
Started from main() beside the sensor sampler, since it needs sim->mtx, and stopped with a
blocking join before either model-replacement path frees the model. Scenes opt in with grasp_*
welds.

